{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D real-time strategy game with base building, resource management, and chaotic slime battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slime Wars</strong>, take command in fast-paced RTS matches where you gather resources, build up your base, train a gooey army, and crush your enemies. Whether you're defending your own slime stronghold or launching an all-out assault, every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build smarter. Attack harder. Emerge victorious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest</strong> resources to expand your economy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and upgrade your base with strategic structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train</strong> unique slime units, each with their own strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong> enemy bases while defending your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt</strong> your strategy in real-time against enemy tactics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>RTS gameplay</strong> with a 2D twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base-building</strong>, <strong>tech progression</strong>, and <strong>unit production</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple <strong>unit types and abilities</strong> to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, chaotic world full of gooey warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo and (future) multiplayer modes planned</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned RTS veteran or new to the genre, <strong>Slime Wars</strong> offers a tight, tactical experience wrapped in a colorful, chaotic world of slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkout the Patreon to support our development!\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win a Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/c249a2d097ef2258945624a71ce3b268573119e6.jpg"},{"name":"Lose a game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/95e676a9c1283f868eeeaf93932cb266fee6db8c.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 10 units","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/76efd48a13ce203f392eaf1af26877e9f2208536.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 100 Units","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/ed0b18d521e12e3a57d93404b915e86aa354c9b0.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 1000 units","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/5bc1d63773d9b0c368b5d2df0cbefc41de8d6b04.jpg"},{"name":"Build all the buildings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/817db7c8ad2df3b593987829a567e0fc87c6d255.jpg"},{"name":"Play the Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/c906a9d000d2d66f782272dac36d6cfea85cfcda.jpg"},{"name":"Kill 5000 Units","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2887080/1b77c81bdee25944d4721fa8f9d49fd32d0c3246.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887080?t=1772250966","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887080?t=1772250966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887080/f3bab1f8917bbde4f736f5b1afa898b97e8983b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772250966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887080/f3bab1f8917bbde4f736f5b1afa898b97e8983b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772250966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22